  "summary": "What's Changed Fix issue where form controls appear above sticky headers by @ds-boyce in #11254 Tweak advanced search UI for better localization by @ds-boyce in #11266 Add new config to lingui too by @estrattonbailey in #11270 ci: publish OTA to denis (S3) + automatic per-PR previews by @amckinley in #11235 ci: skip the per-PR OTA job for bot authors by @am…",
  "content": "<h2>What&#x27;s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix issue where form controls appear above sticky headers by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11254\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11254</a></li>\n<li>Tweak advanced search UI for better localization by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11266\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11266</a></li>\n<li>Add new config to lingui too by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11270\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11270</a></li>\n<li>ci: publish OTA to denis (S3) + automatic per-PR previews by <a href=\"https://github.com/amckinley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amckinley</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11235\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11235</a></li>\n<li>ci: skip the per-PR OTA job for bot authors by <a href=\"https://github.com/amckinley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amckinley</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11273\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11273</a></li>\n<li>Update version to v1.130.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11274\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11274</a></li>\n<li>Migrate <code>runOnUI</code>/<code>runOnJS</code> to <code>scheduleOnUI</code>/<code>scheduleOnRN</code> by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11249\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11249</a></li>\n<li>Fix silently-frozen OTA fingerprint baseline with artifacts by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11231\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11231</a></li>\n<li>Restore PR OTA QR comment by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11285\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11285</a></li>\n<li>Add emoji to GitHub Actions step names for consistency by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11286\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11286</a></li>\n<li>Fix legacy ota1 OTA upload broken by the denis cutover by <a href=\"https://github.com/amckinley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amckinley</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11290\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11290</a></li>\n<li>Publish one bundle version to both OTA origins, not two by <a href=\"https://github.com/amckinley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amckinley</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11291\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11291</a></li>\n<li>Fix tooltip layout measurement loop by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11284\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11284</a></li>\n<li>Fix IllegalStateException: Required value was null. by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11293\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11293</a></li>\n<li>Remove unused ScrollForwarder React Native patches by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11295\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11295</a></li>\n<li>Update play store assetlinks by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11294\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11294</a></li>\n<li>fix: stop grouping all signup failures into one sentry issue by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11278\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11278</a></li>\n<li>ci: only publish the per-PR OTA when the fingerprint is clean by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11287\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11287</a></li>\n<li>Downbump version to v1.129.1 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11297\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11297</a></li>\n<li>Update react-native-uitextview by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11299\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11299</a></li>\n<li>Update sonner-native, remove patch by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11300\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11300</a></li>\n<li>Reenable wake-from-background Android OTA by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11298\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11298</a></li>\n<li>Fix Android pager crash during screen transitions by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11301\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11301</a></li>\n<li>Fix keyboard activation for signin button by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11308\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11308</a></li>\n<li>Update trending topics UI by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11304\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11304</a></li>\n<li>Add trendingTopic:seen metric by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11309\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11309</a></li>\n<li>Bump the actions group with 6 updates by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@dependabot</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11305\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11305</a></li>\n<li>Bump actions/setup-go from 6.5.0 to 7.0.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@dependabot</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11306\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11306</a></li>\n<li>v1.129.1 Release Prep by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11303\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11303</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/compare/1.129.0...1.129.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.129.0...1.129.1</a></p>",
